#: Modals/CXX.md:2
msgid "CXX Environment Variable"
msgstr "環境変数 CXX"

#: Modals/CXX.md:18
msgid ""
"PLUMED 2.4 requires a compiler that supports C++11. The following compilers "
"(or later versions) should be sufficient:"
msgstr "PLUMED 2.4 は C++11 対応 Compiler が必要です。次以降の版で十分です。"

# Compiler name and version intentionally preserved.
#: Modals/CXX.md:20
msgid "gcc 4.8.1"
msgstr "gcc 4.8.1"

# Compiler name and version intentionally preserved.
#: Modals/CXX.md:21
msgid "clang 3.3"
msgstr "clang 3.3"

# Compiler name and version intentionally preserved.
#: Modals/CXX.md:22
msgid "intel 15"
msgstr "intel 15"

#: Modals/CXX.md:32
msgid ""
"We regularly test a number of compilers on <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/plumed/plumed2/actions\">GitHub Actions</a>. These"
" compilers should thus always compile PLUMED correctly."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/plumed/plumed2/actions\">GitHub Actions</a> "
"で定期テストする Compiler は、常に正しくビルドできるはずです。"
